-- build keys in a narrow range: a hash join, whose runtime filter skips most of the sorted probe side
hash join
-- build keys in a narrow range, runtime filters disabled: the hash join reads the whole probe, the sharded merge only its overlap
merge join
-- build keys in a narrow range, skip indexes off at read time: the runtime filter skips nothing, a merge join
merge join
-- build keys spread over the probe range: the runtime filter skips nothing, a merge join
merge join
-- a probe side 50 times the build side: streaming it through the merge costs more than probing, a hash join
hash join
-- floating-point keys: the merge cannot be sharded by key ranges, one stream loses to a hash join
hash join
-- Nullable keys: the merge cannot be sharded by key ranges, one stream loses to a hash join
hash join
-- sorted by the key, but an empty primary key: the merge cannot be sharded, one stream loses to a hash join
hash join
-- read in order by the key after a filter fixes the first primary key column, which the range split needs: a hash join
hash join
-- joined on a monotonic function of the sorting key: read in order, but not split by key ranges, a hash join
hash join
-- primary key on a constant first key only: one key range, one stream loses to a hash join
hash join
-- the same with the second key in the primary key: split by it, a merge join
merge join
-- sharding by primary key ranges disabled: one stream loses to a hash join
hash join
-- two keys, sorted by a low-cardinality first key only: a hash join
hash join
-- two keys, sorted by both, written in another order: a merge join on the keys in sorting key order
merge join
